{"results":[{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mahindra-marina-64/339293/project","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West, Mumbai | Price List & Floor Plan","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Mahindra Lifespaces developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahindra-lifespaces-68.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-project-large-image1-2484.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-floor-plans1-6272.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-amenities-features1-3291.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Virtual Tour](https://img-floorplans.squareyards.com/339293__296212/isometric_floorplan.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mahindra-marina-64-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.78 Cr - 5.41 Cr**\n\n₹35,600 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Mahindra Marina 64?\n\n## About Mahindra Marina 64, Malad West by Mahindra Lifespaces\n\n**Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West feels like a project that leans towards premium living. The focus is more on space, comfort and making everyday life easier rather than just adding fancy elements. The project is coming up in Malad West, which is already a well-established part of Mumbai. Everything is already around like schools, malls, offices and easy availability of transport. So daily life doesn’t feel like a struggle.**\n\n**Homes here are planned with a clear focus on usability. You get decent layouts, good cross ventilation, and natural light that reaches inside the rooms. Many apartments also come with private decks, which is something people genuinely value in Mumbai’s tighter spaces.**\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Details | Information |\n| Project Name | Mahindra Marina 64 |\n| Location | Malad West, Mumbai |\n| Developer | Mahindra Lifespaces |\n| Project Type | Premium Residential Development |\n| Configuration | 2 and 3 BHK Apartments |\n| Land Parcel | Approx. 4.5 Acres |\n| Towers | Multiple towers with high-rise structure |\n| Possession | December 2029 |\n| Project Status | Under Development |\n\nDetails\n\nInformation\n\nProject Name\n\nMahindra Marina 64\n\nLocation\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nDeveloper\n\nMahindra Lifespaces\n\nProject Type\n\nPremium Residential Development\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 and 3 BHK Apartments\n\nLand Parcel\n\nApprox. 4.5 Acres\n\nTowers\n\nMultiple towers with high-rise structure\n\nPossession\n\nDecember 2029\n\nProject Status\n\nUnder Development\n\n**Mahindra Marina 64 is planned like a proper residential community, not just a building with a few add-ons. There’s a mix of lifestyle and everyday amenities.**\n\n**Malad West is already one of those locations where you don’t have to think too much about convenience and connectivity.**\n\n**For anyone working in western suburbs like Goregaon, Andheri, or even Bandra, this location usually works pretty well.**\n\n**This is more of a steady, practical investment rather than something speculative.**\n\n## Mahindra Marina 64 Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Mahindra Marina 64.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  758 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.78 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  765 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.81 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  968 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.55 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1474 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 5.41 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nMahindra Marina 64's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Mahindra Marina 64 | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 35600 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 36000 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 35700 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 33750 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nMahindra Marina 64 avg. price is ₹ 35.6 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kolte Patil Vivere](https://www.squareyards.com/kolte-patil-vivere-goregaon-west-mumbai-npd-343771 \"Kolte Patil Vivere\") | ₹ 36,550 |\n| Current Project **Mahindra Marina 64** | ₹ 35,600 |\n| [Kumar Mangrove](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kumar-mangrove/342930/project \"Kumar Mangrove\") | ₹ 34,650 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,550 |\n| [LnT Ahana](https://www.squareyards.com/lnt-ahana-malad-east-mumbai-npd-344396 \"LnT Ahana\") | ₹ 27,900 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malad West ranges from ₹ 19.9 K to ₹ 1.3 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Mahindra Marina 64 | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Mahindra Marina 64.\n\nA total of 44 residential transactions has been registered so far for Mahindra Marina 64, amounting to ₹ 119 Cr till August 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Mahindra Marina 64 moved from ₹ 35,700/sqft to ₹ 36,000/sqft, reflecting a 0.84% rise.\n\nA new Phase, Tower/Building Name: Mahindra Marina64 - Phase 3, launched under RERA No. PR1182022502265. with targeted completion by 30-Jun-2030.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Mahindra Marina 64 moved from ₹ 33,750/sqft to ₹ 35,700/sqft, reflecting a 5.78% rise.\n\nA new Phase, Tower/Building Name: Mahindra Marina64 - Phase 2, launched under RERA No. PR1181012500523. with targeted completion by 31-Dec-2029.\n\nMahindra Marina64 - Phase 1, developed by Mahindra Lifespace Developers limited, officially launched on 23-Jun-2025 and expected to complete by 31-Dec-2029. Registered under RERA No. PR1181012500087. The project comprises 1 towers with total area of 0.48 Acre.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n44 Sales Transactions Registered in Mahindra Marina 64 From Sep 25 to Aug 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 31.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 44 | ₹ 119 Cr | ₹ 31,200 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Sep 25 to Aug 26\n\n## Mahindra Marina 64 Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 758 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Mahindra Marina 64, Mumbai](https://img-floorplans.squareyards.com/339293__296209/isometric_floorplan.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.78 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 765 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Mahindra Marina 64, Mumbai](https://img-floorplans.squareyards.com/339293__296210/isometric_floorplan.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.81 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 968 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Mahindra Marina 64, Mumbai](https://img-floorplans.squareyards.com/339293__296211/isometric_floorplan.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.55 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 1474 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Mahindra Marina 64, Mumbai](https://img-floorplans.squareyards.com/339293__296212/isometric_floorplan.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 5.41 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Mahindra Marina 64\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Mahindra Marina 64 to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Master Plan 1](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-master-plan-image1-5190.jpg?aio=w-370;h-366;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-floor-plans1-6272.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-amenities-features1-3291.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mahindra-marina-64-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n### Master Plan 1\n\nDownload brochure, master plan & walkthrough video of Mahindra Marina 64 to explore floor plans, layout, and complete project details in Malad West, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Expert Review\n\n![Mahindra Marina 64 | Teaser-Pricing, Offer, Plan [2025] | Mahindra Malad West](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QgWYfgyxFxM/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West Mumbai, Spacious 2,3 & 4BHK Residences.](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tC7bD84VipU/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Mahindra Marina64 Malad West Mumbai | Luxury Is All About Space](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jBpR1q2evjI/hqdefault.jpg)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Mahindra Marina 64\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-readingr-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Mahindra Lifespaces Malad West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Mahindra Marina 64.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Mahindra Marina 64](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-project-large-image1-2484.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Father Angelo High School\n\n#### Mariamman Mandir\n\n#### Jeevan Nursing Home\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malad West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nBypass Road development & proposed highway\n\nAbsence of well developed public transport\n\nAndheri West appeals to me because my interactions are practical and lively. I have great colleges nearby, simple metro access, corporate offices etc. Weekends are spent at parks with family as well as at the beach. Though I adore this location, parking problems and noise have to be addressed quickly.\n\n— Smita Deo, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Mahindra Marina 64\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n44 Sales Transactions Registered in Mahindra Marina 64 From Sep 25 to Aug 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 31.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-04-02 | Floor G, Unit 1 | F | 460 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-04-02 | Floor 19, Unit 1902 | C | 993 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-28 | Floor 17, Unit 1703 | B | 994 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-28 | Floor G, Unit 3 | F | 462 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-27 | Floor 18, Unit 1801 | A | 1,384 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-27 | Floor 13, Unit 1302 | A | 989 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-25 | Floor 19, Unit 1903 | B | 994 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-24 | Floor 6, Unit 604 | D | 746 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-24 | Floor G, Unit 7 | D | 423 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-24 | Floor 16, Unit 1604 | C | 734 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Mahindra Marina 64 compare with similar projects?\n\n![Mahindra Marina 64 project in Malad West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mahindra-marina-64-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Mahindra Marina 64](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mahindra-marina-64/339293/project \"Mahindra Marina 64\")\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Kalpataru Vienta project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-vienta-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Kalpataru Vienta](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-vienta/30226/project \"Kalpataru Vienta\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Chandak Passcode Bay Garden project in Goregaon West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-chandak-passcode-bay-garden-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Chandak Passcode Bay Garden](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-passcode-bay-garden/30561/project \"Chandak Passcode Bay Garden\")\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Mahindra Marina 64 Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Mahindra Marina 64 located at Malad West Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nThere are many positive things about this project. First the developer is one of India's top company. Then I will mention how you will have private living experience with only 46 units here. More greenery and private space. Also family will appreciate so many schools nearby like Billabong.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nI am interested in this project as an agent for its luxury flats, majestic clubhouse, themed gardens, and floating restaurant. Metro and highway connectivity is a plus.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nI am interested in this project as an agent for its luxury flats, majestic clubhouse, themed gardens, and floating restaurant. Metro and highway connectivity is a plus.\n\nOwner\n\nHad so many doubts at first. It's a big investment right? But went ahead since the location seems very appealing. Metro line is coming up with a station near the project and WEH and JVLR can be accessed along with Malad station. Will be less anxious about parents since Zenith and other hospitals are also nearby.\n\nOwner\n\nAn upcoming metro station is being built as I found out, quite near to the project. So will be helpful for future generation, now that Mumbai is all about traffic jams and cars. Also I like the project plan they have put up.\n\nOwner\n\nAm basically putting a bet on the location of the project. Went for it since pricing seemed right after comparing with other projects in the area. Malad station being near to the project is one big advantage and metro line 2B may also be a good thing in future.\n\nOwner\n\nMaze gardens and Olympic pool impressed. This project is good mix of play and exercise.\n\nOwner\n\nI love the low density, high sustainability levels, and high-end amenities. I love the location.\n\nOwner\n\nPricing seems on the higher side for bigger units. At least that's what I feel. The metro line is coming up but no clarity on when competion will be done. I still think airport could be nearer. Now it will take an hour or more in peak traffic. What made me happy was access to Western Express Highway\n\nOwner\n\nI fear of Malad West peak-hour traffic through SV/Link Road impacting daily commutes.\n\n## Mahindra Lifespaces Track Record\n\n![Mahindra Lifespaces logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahindra-lifespaces-68.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nMahindra Lifespace is one of the Indian real estate giants. The real estate and infrastructure development company was founded in 1994. This company is a part of the Mahindra Group. The company is engaged in carrying residential development all across India under Lifespace and Happiness brands. Some of the cities where the Lifespace project exists are Chennai, Jaipur, Hyderabad, Delhi NCR, Nagpur, Ahmedabad, Mumbai, Pune and Bengaluru.\nIn addition, currently, Mahindra Lifespace features 45 residential projects occupying 4,500 acres of land of ongoing integrated cities. The most significant advantage of Mahindra Lifespace is it offers the best residential and commercial real estate properties, lauded with exclusive cluster amenities. The units are professionally designed and strategically located to provide homebuyers with a unique yet easing lifestyle experience. This real estate company engages in the latest innovation in construction to provide quality and elevate living standards. The interiors of the units are even outsourced to national and international consultants, which results in uncompromised deliveries. \nNo wonder, the Mahindra Lifespace matches global standards in building development execution. The lucrative units are nevertheless an architectural masterpiece. Moreover, the offered floor plans satisfy all types of homebuyers with different budgets and preferences. Mahindra Lifespace projects are often situated near several community amenities such as business hubs, corporate parks, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, malls, supermarkets and so on.\n\n![Mahindra Rainforest residential project in Bhandup West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mahindra-rainforest-project-flagship-opt-b4189d65-3362-4753-a007-89bc8ccbb6db.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBhandup West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.76 Cr to 3.43 Cr\n\n![Mahindra BeaconHill residential project in Agripada](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mahindra-beaconhill-project-flagship-opt-bbd