ent For Sale in Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![MANISH SINGH  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![RITESH MISHRA  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Shorap Anil Tiwari  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK + Extra Room Apartment For Sale in Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![MANISH SINGH  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai]()\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n![Suraj Jadhav  profile picture]()\n![Akash Kedarlal Shrivastav]()\n\nThane\n\n![Sachin Gupta]()\n\nThane\n\nNavi Mumbai\n\n![Suraj Santosh Jagdale]()\n\nThane\n\nThane\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Mahindra Marina 64\n\n### Is it suitable for families?\n\nYes, it should work for families. The area itself is already livable, and the project has enough space and amenities to support day-to-day life without feeling too tight.\n\n### Is it a good investment?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 is great for long-term investment. Malad West is already stable, so you’re not betting on future growth alone. Returns may not be very quick, but it’s more of a steady option.\n\n### What is the possession date and RERA number of Mahindra Marina 64?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 is currently New Launch with possession starting from Dec 2029. The RERA registration number is PR1181012500087, PR1181012500523, PR1182022502265.\n\n### What are the flat sizes and configurations available in Mahindra Marina 64, Malad West?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 offers 2, 3, 4 BHK Flats with unit sizes ranging from 758 Sq.Ft. to 1474 Sq.Ft. across 3 towers and 460 total units spread over 4.7 Acres.\n\n### Where is Mahindra Marina 64 located and what are the major connecting roads?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 is located at Malad West Mumbai, Malad West, Mumbai Western Suburbs, Mumbai - 400064. It is well connected via New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, Western Express Highway and is close to landmarks like Orchids The International School, Malad West, Infiniti Mall, Ghodbunder Road.\n\n### Who is the developer of Mahindra Marina 64 and what is their track record?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 is developed by Mahindra Lifespaces, with 25 years of experience and 95.successfully delivered projects\n\n### What are the key amenities of Mahindra Marina 64, Mumbai?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 offers Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Reading Room/Library, Party Hall, Normal Park / Central Green, IGBC Certified Building. It holds an overall rating of 4.1 based on 10 reviews.\n\n### Is Malad West a good area to invest in and what is the rental potential near Mahindra Marina 64?\n\nMalad West is ranked 105 in Mumbai. The average asking price in the locality is ₹ 30,150 /Sq.Ft., with rental prices at ₹ 88 /Sq.Ft.. The locality scores well on liveability (4.4), connectivity (4.1), and lifestyle (4.2).\n\n### What are other residential projects near Mahindra Marina 64?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 is surrounded by several notable residential developments in Mumbai Western Suburbs such as [Runwal Meadows](https://www.squareyards.com/runwal-meadows-kanjurmarg-east-mumbai-npd-343799), [Kolte Patil Serenova](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kolte-patil-serenova/340809/project), [Godrej Skyshore](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-skyshore/339241/project) and many more at [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.squareyards.com/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OJhBQ2a94Hk","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 | 2 & 3 BHK | Project Review | Malad (W)","raw_content":"# Mahindra Marina 64 | 2 & 3 BHK | Project Review | Malad (W)\n## MBTV by Magicbricks\n4660000 subscribers\n26 likes\n\n### Description\n31738 views\nPosted: 22 May 2026\nIn this detailed project review, MBTV takes you through Mahindra Marina 64, a premium residential project by Mahindra Lifespaces.\n\nLocated just 400m from New Link Road, this 3-acre development offers a perfect blend of luxury and connectivity. We break down everything a homebuyer needs to know, from unit configurations and carpet areas to the latest market pricing and possession timelines.\n\nKey Highlights of the Video:\n * Location & Connectivity: Proximity to Malad Metro Station (600m), SV Road, and Mindspace.\n * Project Overview: Detailed look at Towers F & G and the 2-acre recreation space.\n * Unit Details: 2 BHK (760–795 sf) and 3 BHK (970–1,050 sf) configurations.\n * Pricing: Starting at INR 2.75 Cr with car parking details.\n * Amenities: 11,000 sq. ft. clubhouse, half-Olympic size pool, pet park, and more.\n * Social Infrastructure: Nearby schools like Ryan International and hospitals like Sun Hospital.\n * Developer Profile: The legacy of Mahindra Lifespace Developers Ltd.\n\nPossession Date: December 31, 2029 (As per RERA).\n\nRERA ID(Phase 1): PR1181012500087\n\nRERA ID(Phase 2): PR1181012500523\n\nFOLLOW US:\nFACEBOOK:  https://bit.ly/31EGdfn\nTWITTER:   https://bit.ly/3I7zem3 \nINSTAGRAM:   https://bit.ly/3Vsyzi7\nLINKEDIN:   https://bit.ly/47xE8m2\nYOUTUBE: https://bit.ly/3gMLebX\n\nSUBSCRIBE US: http://bit.ly/2E1KLmM\nFOR MORE PROJECTS: https://bit.ly/3juQ9F6\nFOR MORE LOCALITIES: https://bit.ly/3jtBKco\nWEBSITE: https://www.magicbricks.com/\n\n\n### Transcript:\n₹ करोड़ 75 लाख का 2 बीएचके [संगीत] इन मलाड वेस्ट। लेकिन क्या आपको इस प्राइस में सही वैल्यू मिल रही है? आज हम रिव्यु करने वाले हैं Mahindra Marina 64 का लोकेशन से लेके प्राइसिंग तक हर एंगल से। हेलो एंड वेलकम टू एम टीवी। मेरा नाम है शिप्रा आर्य और आज हम आपको लेके चलेंगे मलाड वेस्ट के एक प्रोजेक्ट Mahindra marina 64 के डिटेल्ड प्रोजेक्ट रिव्यु पर। इस वीडियो में हम बात करेंगे [संगीत] लोकेशन, कनेक्टिविटी, प्रोजेक्ट डिटेल्स, अमुनिटीज, प्राइसिंग सभी चीजों की। सो मेक श्योर यू स्टे विद अस टिल दी एंड एंड डू नॉट फॉरगेट टू सब्सक्राइब टू एमबीटी। मलाड वेस्ट मुंबई के वेस्टर्न सबब्स का एक वेल एस्टैब्लिश्ड रेजिडेंशियल और कमर्शियल हब है। यहां स्ट्रांग एंड यूजर और रेंटल डिमांड दोनों ही कंसिस्टेंटली [संगीत] बनी रहती है। अंधेरी और बोरीवली के बीच स्ट्रेटेजिक लोकेशन अलोंग विद इंप्रूविंग इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर इस एरिया को लॉन्ग टर्म ग्रोथ के लिए काफी प्रॉमिसिंग बनाता है। प्रोजेक्ट साइट Mahindra मरीना 64 नेवी नगर रोड मलाड वेस्ट में है जो न्यू लिंक रोड से सिर्फ 400 मीटर और एसवी रोड से करीब 800 मीटर की दूरी पर है। कनेक्टिविटी की बात करें तो नियरेस्ट मेट्रो स्टेशन मलाड वेस्ट मेट्रो है जबकि मलाड रेलवे स्टेशन लगभग 2 किमी दूर है। [संगीत] मुंबई सेंट्रल रेलवे स्टेशन करीब 31 कि.मी. [संगीत] और छत्रपति शिवाजी महाराज इंटरनेशनल एयरपोर्ट तकरीबन 15 कि.मी. की डिस्टेंस पर है। नाउ लेट्स मूव अहेड एंड टेक अ क्लोजर लुक एट द प्रोजेक्ट। [संगीत] Mahindra मरीना 64 मलाड वेस्ट में लगभग 3 एकड़ में फैला एक वी डेवलपमेंट प्रोजेक्ट है। इसे मल्टीपल फेसेस में डेवलप किया जा रहा है। जिसमें करेंटली टावर एफ और टावर जी ल्च हो चुके हैं। दोनों टास्क का पजेशन एस पर रेरा [संगीत] 31 दिसंबर 2029 शेड्यूल्ड है। प्रोजेक्ट में 18 स्टोरी टावर के अंदर टू और 3 बीएचके कॉन्फ़िगरेशंस ऑफर की जा रही हैं। फ्लोर प्लानिंग की बात करें तो दोनों टावर्स में हर फ्लोर पर चार यूनिट्स प्लान है। [संगीत] जिनके लिए दो कॉमन लिस्ट और एक स्टेयरकेस प्रोवाइड की गई है। सभी यूनिट्स के साथ एक बालकनी दी गई है जो वेंटिलेशन और नेचुरल लाइट को एनहांस [संगीत] करती है। द प्रोजेक्ट ऑफर्स 2 बीएचके यूनिट्स विद 760 स्क्वायर फुट एंड 795 [संगीत] स्क्वायर फुट कारपेट एरिया एंड 3 बीएचके विद 970 स्क्वायर फुट एंड 150 स्क्वायर फुट कारपेट एरिया। अमुनिटीज की बात करें तो प्रोजेक्ट में करीब 2 एकड़ का एरिया रिकक्रिएशन [संगीत] के लिए डेडिकेटेड है। साथ ही लगभग 11,000 स्क्वायर फुट का क्लब हाउस डेवलप किया जा रहा है। यहां 20 प्लस लाइफस्टाइल अमिनिटीज इंक्लूड की गई हैं। जैसे जिम, इंडोर [संगीत] गेम्स रूम, मल्टीपर्पस हॉल, बैडमिंटन कोट, योगा और एरियल ग्रो रूम्स, किक [संगीत] बॉक्सिंग एंड एरोबिक स्पेस, हाफ ओलंपिक साइज स्विमिंग पूल, मल्टीपल किड्स प्ले एरियाज और पेट पार्क। [संगीत] [संगीत] अब बात करते हैं प्राइसिंग के बारे में। 760 स्क्वायर फीट वाले 2 बीएचके का स्टार्टिंग प्राइस करीब 2.75 करोड़ [संगीत] है। जिसमें एक कार पार्किंग इंक्लूडेड है। वहीं 3 बीएचके यानी 970 स्क्वायर फुट का स्टार्टिंग प्राइस 3.51 [संगीत] करोड़ है। जिसमें दो पार्किंग्स ऑफर की जा रही हैं। इस लोकालिटी का करंट एवरेज प्राइसिंग लगभग 21,400 पर [संगीत] स्क्वायर फुट के आसपास है। Mahindra Marina 64 को डेवलप कर रहे हैं Mahindra ग्रुप की रियलस्टेट आर्म Mahindra L स्पेसेस डेवलपर्स Limited। द कंपनी वाज़ फॉर्म इन 1994। Mahindra L स्पcees ने मुंबई, पुणे, बेंगलुरु और चेन्नई जैसे की सिटीज में मल्टीपल रेजिडेंशियल प्रोजेक्ट सक्सेसफुली डिलीवर [संगीत] किए हैं और मार्केट में एक रेप्यूटेड और ट्रस्टेड ब्रांड के रूप में जाना जाता है। प्रोजेक्ट की सभी डिटेल समझने के बाद अब नजर डालते हैं यहां के सोशल इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर पर। क्योंकि एंड यूजर के लिए यह फैक्टर भी इक्वली रेलेवेंट होता है। मलाट वेस्ट एक ऐसा लोकेशन है जहां आपकी डेली नीड्स और [संगीत] एसेंशियल सर्विज इजीली एक्सेसिबल है। एजुकेशन के लिए रन इंटरनेशनल स्कूल और किड्स इंटरनेशनल स्कूल और श्रीमती केजी मित्तल [संगीत] इंस्टट्यूट जैसे ऑप्शंस 2 कि.मी. के रेट में है। जिसमें से कुछ इंस्टट्यूट्स प्रोजेक्ट [संगीत] से वॉकिंग डिस्टेंस पर है। हेल्थ केयर फैसिलिटीज जैसे सन हॉस्पिटल [संगीत] 2 कि.मी. के अंदर लोकेटेड है। शॉपिंग और एंटरटेनमेंट के लिए इंफिनिटी मॉल और DMA लगभग 1 कि.मी. पर है। जबकि इनोबिट मॉल करीब 2 कि.मी. दूर है। साथ ही माइंड स्पेस मलाड जो एक मेजर कमर्शियल हब है सिर्फ 2 कि.मी. के डिस्टेंस पर है जो वर्किंग प्रोफेशनल्स के लिए एक एडेड एडवांटेज है। ओवरऑल मलार्ड वेस्ट स्ट्रांग सोशल इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर के साथ एक वेल राउंडेड रेजिडेंशियल [संगीत] डेस्टिनेशन ऑफर करता है। तो ओवरऑल देखा जाए तो मलाड वेस्ट एक इवॉल्विंग रेजिडेंशियल हब [संगीत] है जो कनेक्टिविटी इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर और लाइफस्टाइल का स्ट्रांग मिक्स ऑफर करता है। मिड सेगमेंट हो या फिर प्रीमियम होम बायर्स। दोनों के लिए ही यह लोकेशन एक लॉन्ग टर्म पर्सपेक्टिव [संगीत] से काफी रेलेवेंट बनी हुई है। एंड दैट इज ऑल इन टुडेेस वीडियो। अगर आपको यह वीडियो पसंद आया हो तो लाइक और शेयर करें। साथ ही एमबीबी टीवी को सब्सक्राइब करना ना भूलें। कैमरा पर्सन संजय के साथ दिस शिप्रा आर्य। सी यू इन द नेक्स्ट वीडियो।","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertypistol.com/projects/mahindra-marina-64-malad-west-pid-20060","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad West, Mumbai - Price, Brochure, Floor Plan, Location","raw_content":"1. [Home](/)\n2. /\n3. [Mumbai](/mumbai)\n4. /\n5. [Flats for sale in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n6. /\n7. [New Projects in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n8. /\n9. [New Projects in Malad West](/mumbai/buy/real-estate-projects-in-malad-west)\n10. /\n11. Mahindra Marina 64\n\n# Mahindra Marina 64\n\nFlats by **[Mahindra Lifespaces](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-mahindra-lifespaces)** at Mahindra Marina64, Navy Nagar Road, Malad, Navy Colony, Liberty Garden, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nPR1181012500087\n\nPR1181012500523\n\nPR1182022502265\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR1.8 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR1.8 Cr\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations2 BHK, 4 BHK\n\nPossession DateDec 2029\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area600 - 1,474\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 30.0 K per Sqft.\n\n[![Mahindra Marina 64 Master Plan]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/master_plans/20060/original/mp.PNG?1750919982)\n\n[![Mahindra Marina 64 Floor Plan]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/files/8403/original/fp.PNG?1750919983)\n\n[![Mahindra Marina 64 Flat 2 BHK]()](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/website-prod-public/two_d_plans/117198/original/2b.jpg?1750919982)\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nPR1181012500087\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details\n\nPR1181012500523\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details\n\nPR1182022502265\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://mahindralifespacesupcoming.com/mumbai/mahindra-marina-64","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 | Malad West | Mumbai | Location | Possesion Date | RERA","raw_content":"![Mahindra Marina 64 Banner Images](images/Mahindra-Codename64.jpg)\n\n# Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West\n\nAt Malad West, Mumbai\n\n## About Mahindra Lifespaces Marina 64 Malad West\n\n**Mahindra Lifespaces Marina 64** is a new launch residential development project by **Mahindra Lifespaces** in **Malad West, Mumbai**. Spread across **4.5 acres**, the project offers well-planned **2 and 3 BHK apartments**, with sizes ranging from **758 to 969.94 sq. ft.** The homes are designed for comfort and style, and come with all the modern amenities needed for a better lifestyle. Starting from **₹2.75 Cr\\***, these homes are ideal for those looking to live in a quality space in a good Mumbai neighbourhood.\n\nThe project is located in **Malad West**, one of the most well-connected and developed areas in Mumbai. It has easy access to Link Road, SV Road, and the Western Express Highway. Malls like Inorbit and Infinity, schools, hospitals, and offices like Mindspace and Malad IT Park are all nearby. The upcoming Metro Line will further improve travel. This location makes everyday living easier and saves families and working professionals time.\n\nThis project is **RERA Approved** and the expected possession date is **December 2029**. Since this is a New Launch project by a trusted name like Mahindra Lifespaces, it is a good time to invest. Property prices in this area are growing steadily, making it a smart choice for both homebuyers and investors.\n\n### **Project Details:**\n\n### **Key Interior Features:**\n\n## Price of Apartments at Mahindra Marina 64\n\nThe apartments at Mahindra Marina 64 are attractively priced, starting from ₹2.75 Cr\\*. For this price, buyers get access to premium 2 and 3 BHK homes sized between 758 to 969.94 sq. ft., located in the sought-after area of Malad West, Mumbai. The cost reflects not just the spacious design and top-class amenities but also the high land value of this prime neighbourhood. Given the rising property rates in this locality, the current pricing offers a smart entry point for buyers looking for long-term value and appreciation.\n\n| Unit Type | Size (Carpet) Sq.ft | Approx. Price (in ₹) |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 758 sq. ft. | ₹2.75 Cr\\* | Enquire Now |\n| 3 BHK | 969.94 sq. ft. | ₹ 3.33 Cr\\* | Enquire Now |\n\n## Amenities at Mahindra Lifespaces Marina 64\n\n![Mini Theatre](images/amenities/mini-theatre.svg)\n\n**Mini Theatre**\n\n![clean-house](images/amenities/clean-house.svg)\n\n**Clubhouse**\n\n![Meditation Pod](images/amenities/meditation.svg)\n\n**Meditation Pod**\n\n![Swimming Pool](images/amenities/swimming-pool.svg)\n\n**Swimming Pool**\n\n![Gymnasium](images/amenities/dumbbell.svg)\n\n**Gymnasium**\n\n![Amphitheatre](images/amenities/amphitheatre.svg)\n\n**Amphitheatre**\n\n![Kids’ Play Area](images/amenities/tennis-player.svg)\n\n**Kids’ Play Area**\n\n![Cafeteria](images/amenities/cafe.svg)\n\n**Cafeteria**\n\n![Skating Rink](images/amenities/skate.svg)\n\n**Skating Rink**\n\n![Step Garden](images/amenities/gardening.svg)\n\n**Step Garden**\n\nMahindra Lifespaces Marina 64 comes with well-planned amenities that make everyday life more comfortable and enjoyable for all age groups. The project includes useful facilities for fitness, leisure, and relaxation. From quiet spaces to active areas, everything is thoughtfully designed to suit the needs of today’s families. These features help residents enjoy quality time, stay healthy, and connect with neighbours—all within the comfort of their own residential community.\n\n### **Key Amenities**\n\n## Master Plan and Floor Plan\n\n### **Master Plan**\n\n![Master Plan](images/Mahindra-master.jpg)\n\n### **Floor Plan**\n\n![floor plan 1](images/64-2bhk.JPG)\n\n#### 2 BHK\n\n![floor plan 2](images/64-3bhk.JPG)\n\n#### 3 BHK\n\n## Gallery Images\n\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Gallery Image](images/gallery/gallery-img.JPG)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Gallery Image](images/gallery/gallery-img1.JPG)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Gallery Image](images/gallery/gallery-img2.JPG)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Gallery Image](images/gallery/gallery-img3.JPG)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Gallery Image](images/gallery/gallery-img5.jpg)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Gallery Image](images/gallery/gallery-img4.JPG)\n![Mahindra Marina 64 Gallery Image](images/gallery/gallery-img6.jpg)\n\n## Location and Connectivity\n\nMahindra Lifespaces Marina 64 is located in a peaceful yet well-connected part of Malad West, Mumbai. This area is known for its good roads, easy access to daily needs, and modern lifestyle. With many schools, hospitals, malls, and workspaces nearby, it is a perfect location for families and working professionals. The area has seen good development and has everything needed for a comfortable and convenient life.\n\n### **Key Connectivity**\n\n### **Road Access**\n\n### **Train Connectivity**\n\n### **Upcoming Metro**\n\n### **Schools & Colleges Nearby**\n\n### **Hospitals Nearby**\n\n### **Malls & Recreation**\n\n## About Developers\n\nMahindra Lifespaces is a well-known real estate company in India and is part of the Mahindra Group. Started in 1994, the company has built many good-quality homes, townships, and industrial spaces in cities like Mumbai, Pune, Chennai, Bengaluru, and Delhi-NCR. Their focus is on building strong and modern homes that improve people’s lifestyle. They also believe in green building practices, using eco-friendly methods like rainwater harvesting and energy-saving systems in their projects.\n\nThe company has completed over 21 million sq. ft. of residential space and is working on many more projects across the country. People trust Mahindra Lifespaces for timely delivery, clean work, and good customer support. Their homes come with proper planning, useful amenities, and safe surroundings. The builder keeps everything transparent, from the booking stage to possession. Because of their good name and honest work, many families choose Mahindra Lifespaces to find their dream home.\n\n## Why Should You Invest in Mahindra Lifespaces Marina 64?\n\nMahindra Lifespaces Marina 64 presents a strong investment opportunity due to its planned development in a high-demand residential zone. With future growth potential, modern apartment options, and lifestyle-focused features, it attracts both end-users and investors. The project is backed by Mahindra Lifespaces, ensuring trusted construction and timely progress. The area’s rising property rates and increasing infrastructure upgrades make this project a smart choice for long-term value and rental income with good capital appreciation scope.\n\n### **Key Investment Points**\n\n## FAQs – Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West\n\n## Enquire Now\n\nExplore Projects\n\nPopular Projects\n\nTop Locations\n\nMahindra Lifespaces Projects\n\nMahindra Lifespaces is one of India's leading real estate developers, offering thoughtfully designed apartments, villas, plotted developments, and integrated townships. With projects across Bangalore, Mumbai, Pune, Chennai, Thane, Jaipur, and Gurgaon, the company is known for sustainable communities, premium amenities, and exceptional construction quality. Explore new launch, upcoming, and pre-launch Mahindra Lifespaces projects to find your ideal home.\n\nQuick Links\n\nThe content provided on this website is 