.\nMahindra Lifespaces benefits from a strong brand reputation inherited from the Mahindra Group, fostering trust among customers. The company is committed to sustainable development practices, incorporating eco-friendly features into its projects. With a diversified portfolio and a strong geographic presence across major Indian cities, Mahindra Lifespaces caters to a wide customer base.\nRecent highlights for the company include consistent growth in residential sales, expansion of its integrated city and industrial cluster portfolio, and a strong emphasis on sustainability initiatives. Mahindra Lifespaces is a dynamic real estate company shaping the Indian real estate landscape through its innovative projects, commitment to sustainability, and customer-centric approach.\n\n## QR Codes of Mahindra Marina 64\n\n![PR1181012500087.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/kQUaR5CrmuSbnCOwiLkHLtxRh7NxLcpN4JTxXVEz.webp)\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Mahindra Marina 64\n\nWhat is the address of Mahindra Marina 64?\n\nThe Mahindra Marina 64 is located at 5RPQ+JJJ Mahindra Lifespaces, Navy Nagar Rd, Malad, Navy Colony, Liberty Garden, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra. [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Mahindra Marina 64?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 Malad West RERA number is PR1181012500087.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 offers premium 2,3 BHK Apartment flats for sale in Malad West.\n\nWhat is the starting price of a flat at Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 flat price in Malad West starts at ₹ 2.62 Cr Onwards.\n\n...\n\nHow many floors are there in the Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West project?\n\nThe Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West project boasts 18 storeys offering well-planned layouts and modern amenities.\n\nWhat is the Possession Date of Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West?\n\nThe project is Under Construction   \nThe Mah